Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["The following computation took place in Ben\[CloseCurlyQuote]n\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]Henry\[CloseCurlyQuote]s NVIDIA B200 Linux machine.\n",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "NVIDIA B200 on vuonna 2024 julkaistu eritt\[ADoubleDot]in tehokas, \
Blackwell-arkkitehtuuriin perustuva ammattilais-GPU, joka on suunniteltu teko\
\[ADoubleDot]lyn koulutukseen ja p\[ADoubleDot]\[ADoubleDot]ttelyyn. \nSe \
tarjoaa 192 Gt HBM3e-muistia, jopa 18 PFLOPSin FP4-suorituskyvyn (sparse) ja \
kaksi kertaa enemm\[ADoubleDot]n suorituskyky\[ADoubleDot] kuin H100, \
kuluttaen jopa 1000 W. \nKeskeiset tiedot: Arkkitehtuuri: Blackwell \
(GB100-prosessori). Muisti: 180-192 Gt HBM3e. Suorituskyky: Suunniteltu \
valtaviin teko\[ADoubleDot]lymalleihin, sis\[ADoubleDot]lt\[ADoubleDot]\
\[ADoubleDot] 592 tensor-ydint\[ADoubleDot]. \
Liit\[ADoubleDot]nt\[ADoubleDot]: PCI-Express 5.0 x16.\nK\[ADoubleDot]ytt\
\[ODoubleDot]kohteet: NVIDIA DGX B200 -j\[ADoubleDot]rjestelm\[ADoubleDot] \
yhdist\[ADoubleDot]\[ADoubleDot] kahdeksan B200 GPU:ta AI-infrastruktuuria \
varten. https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/data-center/dgx-b200/0\n\nThe B200 is a \
professional graphics card by NVIDIA, launched in 2024. Built on the 5 nm \
process, and based on the GB100 graphics processor, the card does not support \
DirectX. Since B200 does not support DirectX 11 or DirectX 12, it might not \
be able to run all the latest games. B200 combines two graphics processors to \
increase performance. It features 18944 shading units, 592 texture mapping \
units, and 24 ROPs, per GPU. Also included are 592 tensor cores which help \
improve the speed of machine learning applications. NVIDIA has paired 180 GB \
HBM3e memory with the B200, which are connected using a 4096-bit memory \
interface per GPU (each GPU manages 92,160 MB). The GPU is operating at a \
frequency of 700 MHz, which can be boosted up to 1965 MHz, memory is running \
at 2000 MHz.\nBeing a sxm module card, its power draw is rated at 1000 W \
maximum. This device has no display connectivity, as it is not designed to \
have monitors connected to it. B200 is connected to the rest of the system \
using a PCI-Express 5.0 x16 interface.\n\nGraphics Processor GB100 x2 Cores \
18944 x2 TMUs 592 x2 ROPs 24 x2 Memory Size 90 GB x2 Memory Type HBM3e Bus \
Width 4096 bit x2"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.979712796684576*^9, 3.9797128864631786`*^9}, {
  3.9797130356256638`*^9, 3.9797130548764515`*^9}, {3.9797130887646523`*^9, 
