Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[StyleBox["Summary of all the above cases of 1st 2nd 3rd 4th",
 FontWeight->"Bold"]], "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9810401791174183`*^9, 
  3.981040247649126*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c4fac8b7-135c-b644-90a6-\
668dd929b5f2"],

Cell["\<\
AA2F 3-LET WL 40 RED

1st case, Extensions to both sides: 46, Max Steps 10M
Extendable_allxyz (SFSG) = 6839935+9668431+9476991+10778854 = 36764211
Remaining Undecided = 4222+4387+4773+5302 = 18684
All the above = 36764211+18684 = 36782895

2nd case, Extensions to both sides: 46, Max Steps 10M
Extendable_allxyz (SFSG) = 7141427+10119596+12100022 = 29361045
Remaining Undecided = 3714+4938+5734 = 14386
All the above = 29361045+14386 = 29375431

3rd case, Extensions to both sides: 46, Max Steps 10M
Extendable_allxyz (SFSG) = 7903648+9557526+11574950 = 29036124
Remaining Undecided = 4377+4297+5396 = 14070
All the above = 29036124+14070 = 29050194

4th case, Extensions to both sides: 46, Max Steps 10M
Extendable_allxyz (SFSG): 991853+4786671+6381438+7830929+9104629 = 29095520
Remaining Undecided = 425+2509+3026+3708+4724 = 14392
All the above = 29095520+14392 = 29109912

