Cell[TextData[{
 "I have now installed the latest NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit 13.1\nHowever, \
Mathematica does not know about it and cannot install the CUDALink:\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "InstallCUDA", "noins", "\"CUDALink could not be installed.\"", 2, 2, 1, 
    34652038291250862253, "Local", "CUDALink`InstallCUDA"},
   "MessageTemplate2",
   BaseStyle->"MSG"]],
  CellChangeTimes->{3.975252441106573*^9, 3.975252952107582*^9, 
   3.975743332104723*^9},ExpressionUUID->
  "43b08548-3a23-5c49-ab3b-5216d0869112"],
 "\nI do also know, where the nvcc.exe is . It is in C:\\Program \
Files\\NVIDIA GPU Computing Toolkit\\CUDA\\v13.1\\bin>.\nHow should I proceed \
to make  Mathematica to install the CUDALink and start working with the CUDA \
kernels of  my GPU?\nPlease advise. Thank you.\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9757423619722633`*^9, 3.975742373632389*^9}, {
  3.9757433709808807`*^9, 3.9757436895028515`*^9}, {3.97574385989785*^9, 
  3.975743863055668*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3ea96ff0-8dc7-1b4f-a5f0-\
92941a562806"],

