Cell["\<\
Wow! Got the message: \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Library Loaded. Function \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]cudaLibFun\[CloseCurlyQuote] is ready.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] 
This even though Mathematica tels me that CUDALink is not supported on this \
system.

But, how should I now run the test function aa2fInt32MakeFreeWordCUDA ?\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975755548341137*^9, 3.9757555686318398`*^9}, {
  3.9757556002241783`*^9, 3.9757556413836365`*^9}, {3.975755675048422*^9, 
  3.9757556995414677`*^9}, {3.9757559395210533`*^9, 
  3.9757559663082275`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d1f897c3-d0fe-ae40-9abd-\
9bd524e991ea"],

Cell["\<\
That is fantastic news! You have successfully bypassed the limitations of \
Mathematica' s built - in CUDALink by manually compiling a DLL that talks \
directly to your Blackwell GPU. Now that the library function cudaLibFun is \
loaded, you just need the Mathematica wrapper code to format the data, call \
that library function, and decode the results . I have updated the Canvas to \
include : The helper functions (stringToCudaInts, valMap) to convert strings \
like \"abX\" into integers . The main function aa2fInt32MakeFreeWordCUDA \
which calls your new DLL . A test block at the end to generate random words \
and solve them . You can now run the cells below the \"STEP 5\" header .\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975756650231476*^9, 
  3.9757566870455894`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fcaf5e85-f191-9742-9eed-\
74e71b40b67f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"--", 
      RowBox[{"-", "STEP"}]}], " ", "6"}], ":", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"TEST", " ", 
      RowBox[{"EXECUTION", "--"}]}], "-"}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"nonCharVars", "=", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"X", ",", "Y", ",", "Z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"charVars", "=", 
     RowBox[{"ToString", "/@", "nonCharVars"}]}], ";"}], 
   "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{"Generate", " ", "20", " ", "random", " ", "test", " ", "cases"}],
     "*)"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"testData", "=", 
    RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"StringJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"RandomChoice", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<a\>\"", ",", "\"\<b\>\"", ",", "\"\<c\>\""}], "}"}], ",",
           "5"}], "]"}], ",", "\"\<X\>\"", ",", 
        RowBox[{"RandomChoice", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<a\>\"", ",", "\"\<b\>\"", ",", "\"\<c\>\""}], "}"}], ",",
           "5"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", "20", "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9757573628939877`*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[12]:=",ExpressionUUID->"0ef9ea59-6a2f-0a4b-9979-3e96569e0ebc"],

