     ColorFunction->RGBColor],
    BoxForm`ImageTag["Byte", Interleaving -> True, ColorSpace -> "RGB"],
    Selectable->False],
   BaseStyle->"ImageGraphics",
   ImageSize->{375., Automatic},
   ImageSizeRaw->{561, 316},
   PlotRange->{{0, 561}, {0, 316}}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 Cell["Different levels of memory available for CUDA.", "MathCaption",
   ExpressionUUID->"6c312bf0-2282-9943-a5e9-1aaf9f311891"]}], "Picture",
  ExpressionUUID->"fef5ba09-eba4-e24b-ad1d-9bfc50d2c8a2"],
 "\n",
 StyleBox["Global Memory",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nThe most abundant (but slowest) memory available on the GPU. This is the \
memory advertised on the packaging\[LongDash]128, 256, or 512 MB. All threads \
can access elements in global memory, although for performance reasons these \
accesses tend to be kept to a minimum and have further constrictions on them.\
\nThe performance constrictions on global memory have been relaxed on recent \
hardware and will likely be relaxed even further. The general rule is that \
performance is deteriorated if global memory is accessed more than once.\n",
 StyleBox["Texture Memory",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nTexture memory resides in the same location as global memory, but it is \
read-only. Texture memory does not suffer for the performance deterioration \
found in global memory. On the flip side, only ",
 StyleBox["char", "InlineCode",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["int", "InlineCode",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", and ",
 StyleBox["float", "InlineCode",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " are supported types.\n",
 StyleBox["Constant Memory",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nFast constant memory that is accessible from any thread in the grid. The \
memory is cached, but limited to 64 KB globally.\n",
 StyleBox["Shared Memory",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "\nFast memory that is local to a specific block. On current hardware, the \
amount of shared memory is limited to 16 KB per block.\n\nGPU has different \
kinds of memories (",
 "Global, Texture, Constant, Shared).",
 StyleBox[" ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975425814241146*^9, 3.975425855480097*^9}, {
  3.9754258982131176`*^9, 3.975425900119982*^9}, {3.975426484006817*^9, 
  3.975426494755312*^9}, {3.9775822229550858`*^9, 3.9775822334213295`*^9}, {
  3.9788405590270233`*^9, 
  3.9788406403845177`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"c4bfb6a7-5d24-3d46-90c0-\
dfad621e5bf2"],

