Cell["\<\
The first substantial computation we need to develop for words over three \
letters is for aa2f words of length 24. After preliminary reductions, their \
number will be about 500000. Each of the words needs to be extended by aa2f  \
fashion by length 6, or preferably more, to the left and to the right at the \
same time. In the first phase, only those words which cannot be extended this \
way should be listed. The assumption is that most words cannot be extended in \
an aa2f fashion, but this may require larger extensions than current \
technology supports. But let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s give it a try. 

Here is an example run using Mathematica. Note that the variable names are \
selected carefully. Another ordering would lead to much longer computation \
time. 

Anyway, in our CUDA case, it is hard to say in advance whether the order of \
variable names will be significant. And yes, this can be made much faster in \
Mathematica, but in CUDA programming, it is not clear whether a speedup will \
be achieved, as back-and-forth traffic could reduce efficiency.

Here I will show only a simple example, where the function  \
aa2fMakeFreeWord3let  does too much testing because it does not utilise the \
fact that the given word \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]aaabaaacccbccaabbbaccbcc\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] of length 24 is already aa2f (almost abelian \
square-free).
Remember also that, in our CUDA case, we may not need to enumerate all \
extension possibilities exhaustively.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.975852632298607*^9, 3.9758526836483746`*^9}, {
   3.9758527299710464`*^9, 3.97585293740271*^9}, {3.9758529674551353`*^9, 
   3.9758532660268955`*^9}, {3.9758533073179436`*^9, 
   3.9758533685794964`*^9}, {3.975853399772558*^9, 3.9758535862330265`*^9}, {
   3.9758538850106697`*^9, 3.9758539352019367`*^9}, {3.975853991273432*^9, 
   3.9758540218921833`*^9}, {3.975854054526596*^9, 3.9758543143754063`*^9}, {
   3.9758544891117764`*^9, 3.975854490188423*^9}, {3.975854545547447*^9, 
   3.9758545733240776`*^9}, {3.975854638753311*^9, 3.975854749846056*^9}, 
   3.975854816586132*^9},ExpressionUUID->"7eba2537-906e-584c-b0f2-\
0df29c2bc250"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(", 
   RowBox[{"myRes", "=", 
    RowBox[{"aa2fMakeFreeWord3let", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"StringReverse", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<aaabaaacccbccaabbbaccbcc\>\"", "<>", "\"\<AFHLPR\>\""}], 
       "]"}], "<>", "\"\<BGJMQS\>\""}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "//", 
  "AbsoluteTiming"}]], "Input",
